Workspace for Static Checks

"Read the comments in the code for a description of each check"
"The code is located in System-Support>>SystemDictionary>>static checks"

"To check miscellaneous stuff"
Smalltalk checkOrganizations.				"prints results in Transcript"
Smalltalk browseAllNonAsciiMessages.		"takes a long time"
Smalltalk findAllNonAsciiSources inspect.	"takes a long time"
Smalltalk findSharedPoolVariables inspect.	"takes a short time"

"To collect and output statistics"
Smalltalk printAllMessagesOn: (FileStream fileNamed: 'Smalltalk.allMessages').
Smalltalk printCategoryNamesOn: (FileStream fileNamed: 'Smalltalk.categories').
Smalltalk printInstanceCountsOn: (FileStream fileNamed: 'Smalltalk.instanceCounts').
Smalltalk printInstanceVariablesNotReferencedOn: (FileStream fileNamed: 'Smalltalk.unrefedIvars').
Smalltalk printMessageUsageOn: (FileStream fileNamed: 'Smalltalk.messageCounts').
Smalltalk printMultipleCategoryMessageNamesOn: (FileStream fileNamed: 'Smalltalk.multCats').
Smalltalk printOnlyReturnSelvesOn: (FileStream fideNamed: 'Smalltalk.unimplementeds').
Smalltalk printReceivedButNotSentOn: (FileStream fileNamed: 'Smalltalk.receivedButNotSent').
Smalltalk printSentButNotReceivedOn: (FileStream fileNamed: 'Smalltalk.sentButNotReceived').
Smalltalk printSing,eClassCategoryNamesOn: (FileStream fileNamed: 'Smalltalk.singles').
Smalltalk printUnaryCategoryNamesOn: (FileStream fileNamed: 'Smalltalk.unaries').
Smalltalk printUnresponsivesOn: (FileStream fileNamed: 'Smalltalk.subclassUnimps').

Benchmar+ testStandardToFile: (FileStream fileNamed: 'Smalltalk.timing').

